 * {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}}
** Storm Hammer is a unit-targeted area-of-effect ability, its ability target reticule must be unit-targeted on an enemy unit.
** [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-1.png|84px]]
*** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{calc|v1+{{#var:Storm Hammer cast range}}|v1={{#var:Storm Hammer value1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1+{{#var:Storm Hammer cast range agh}}|v1={{#var:Storm Hammer value1}}}}|agh}})-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].

* The ability has two main components
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
*** Launches a {{#var:Storm Hammer basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed|text=speed}} projectile to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit's {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} area-targeted location.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
**** Grants a non-lingering {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} 225-radius [[flying vision]] as the [[projectile]] travels.
*** {{cf|aghnotes}}
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Run}}
***** With {{M|Alt-Cast}} enabled, the ability applies a {{M|Disable|text=disabling}} {{M|forced movement}} that {{M|stuns}} and moves Sven periodically with the projectile at {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Storm Hammer basic1}}*{{#var:Storm Hammer type1 value2 agh}}}}|agh}}-speed.
***** Does not {{M|disjoint}} incoming {{M|projectiles}}.
***** Can move over {{M|impassable terrain}} and over {{M|trees}}.
***** Grants Sven the following ability effects during the dash:
****** {{M|Cannot act}}.
****** Has 0-{{M|bound radius}}.
****** {{M|Hidden}}
****** {{M|Invulnerable}}
****** {{M|Untargetable}}
**** {{Symbol|Projectile|Run}}
***** The dash component is interrupted by the following sources:
****** Upon Sven's {{M|death}}.
****** Whenever the distance between Sven and the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit exceeds the {{ValueColor||{{#var:Storm Hammer type1 value1 agh}}|agh}}-dash distance at any time during the dash.
***** Since the projectile component is independent of the dash component, the projectile does not stop.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** The ability effects are applied as follows upon projectile impact:
***# {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Applies the {{M|basic dispel}} on all affected enemy units within the radius.
***# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
***#* {{cf|aghnotes}} Checks and applies the damage bonus increase if Sven arrives the projectile impact location.
***# {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[stun]]ned}}

* {{cf|talnotes}}
** {{Symbol|bonus cd}}
*** Does not reduce the ability's current [[cooldown]] value immediately upon learning the {{M|talent|t=t3r}}.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} Checks if Sven has the {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}} during the ability's {{M|cast point}}.
** {{M|Alt-Cast}} is disabled by default upon acquiring the ability upgrade.
** {{Symbol|bonus cas}}
*** Does not grant Sven the dash ability effects whenever the distance between Sven and the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit exceeds the max dash distance.
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Fogged}} units.
*** {{M|Invisible}} units.
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Storm Hammer icon0}}
| desc = Sven unleashes his magical gauntlet that deals damage and stuns enemy units in a small area around the target.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** Sven's weapon emit particles during Storm Hammer's {{M|cast point}} visible to everyone.

