 * {{Symbol|Cleave}}
** Deals {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}} correspondingly to Sven's attack damage value, and is defined as:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cleave]]Dmg {{=}} [[Attack Damage#Total Attack Damage|ΣAtkDmg]] × f(Cleave)}}
** Affected by {{M|damage block}} sources on the enemy individually within the area-of-effect.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Flag}} Has the following damage flags:
*** {{M|No-spell-lifesteal}}
*** {{M|No-spell-amplification}}
** Stack independently with other {{M|cleave|x}} sources.
** {{hi|Sven}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} {{Symbol|Target|Cleave90|size=42px}}
*** The total ability area-of-effect is an [[wikipedia:Isosceles trapezoid|isocseles trapezoid]] in front of Sven.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Great Cleave icon0}}
| desc = Sven strikes with great force, cleaving all nearby enemy units with his attack.
}}
* {{Symbol|Cleave}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The damage is applied immediately to all valid enemy units within the area-of-effect regardless of the ability visual effects.
** Does not proc [[cleave]] when attacking the following units:
*** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
** Does not damage the following units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}
** Neither proc nor damage the following units:
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

